msgstr "تهيئة عهدة مندوبي المشتريات"

#. module: baseer_procurement_requests
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:baseer_procurement_requests.view_company_representative_petty_cash
msgid "Creates the missing shared account and general journal once for this company. It does not create a payment point or an account for each representative."
